--[[
    AimAssistGUI.lua
    Place this as a LocalScript inside StarterPlayerScripts.

    Features:
    - Draggable, collapsible GUI window
    - Aim Helper toggle (F key or button)
    - Team Check toggle (skip teammates)
    - "Only while aiming" toggle (only assist while RMB/right trigger held)
    - Settings panel with sliders: Radius, Cone Angle, Strength, Smoothness
    - On-screen FOV circle showing the assist cone while enabled
    - Smarter target picking: weighs both angle-from-crosshair AND distance,
      so it doesn't lock onto a far target just because it's dead-center
--]]

